x.html\">Projected OGD: Orabona Chapter 2</a></dd></div>\n+    <div><dt>Declarations</dt><dd>1</dd></div>\n+    <div><dt>Placeholders</dt><dd>0</dd></div>\n+  </dl>\n+  <h3>Imports</h3>\n+  <p><span class=\"empty\">No project-local imports.</span></p>\n+  <h3>Imported by</h3>\n+  <p><a href=\"../banditrlproof/index.html\"><code>BanditRLProof</code></a></p>\n+</section>\n+\n+<section id=\"declarations\">\n+  <h2>Declarations</h2>\n+  <p>Open an item to read its exact compact statement and source link. Detailed teaching notes are linked when registered.</p>\n+  <div class=\"declaration-list\">\n+<details class=\"declaration\" id=\"decl-3d85ef2d0774\">\n+  <summary>\n+    <span class=\"kind\">theorem</span>\n+    <code>BanditRL.OnlineCumulativePotential.finite_regret_identity</code>\n+    <span><span class=\"status compiled\">Compiled</span> </span>\n+  </summary>\n+  <div class=\"declaration-content\">\n+    <p class=\"empty\">No declaration docstring is present; use the chapter context and exact statement below.</p>\n+    <div class=\"node-memberships\"><p><strong>Used in these reading views:</strong> <a href=\"../../books/online-learning/index.html\">Online Learning Book</a></p>\n+<p><a href=\"../../chapters/online-ogd/index.html\">Projected OGD: Orabona Chapter 2</a></p>\n+<details><summary>Canonical node identity</summary><code>declaration:BanditRL.OnlineCumulativePotential.finite_regret_identity</code><p>Reading membership is not a proof dependency. Exact assumptions remain in the Lean statement.</p></details></div>\n+    <pre class=\"lean-code\"><code><span class=\"kw\">theorem</span> finite_regret_identity {E : Type*} (psi loss : ℕ → E → ℝ) (x : ℕ → E) (u z : E) (T : ℕ) (hT : <span class=\"num\">0</span> &lt; T) : <span class=\"kw\">let</span> y : ℕ → E := <span class=\"kw\">fun</span> t =&gt; <span class=\"kw\">if</span> t = T <span class=\"kw\">then</span> z <span class=\"kw\">else</span> x t <span class=\"kw\">let</span> G : ℕ → E → ℝ := <span class=\"kw\">fun</span> t v =&gt; psi t v + ∑ i ∈ range (t + <span class=\"num\">1</span>), loss i v (∑ t ∈ range T, (loss t (y t) - loss t u)) = psi (T - <span class=\"num\">1</span>) u - psi <span class=\"num\">0</span> (y <span class=\"num\">0</span>) + (∑ t ∈ range T, (G t (y t) - G t (y (t + <span class=\"num\">1</span>)))) + (∑ t ∈ range (T - <span class=\"num\">1</span>), (psi t (y (t + <span class=\"num\">1</span>)) - psi (t + <span class=\"num\">1</span>) (y (t + <span class=\"num\">1</span>)))) + G (T - <span class=\"num\">1</span>) z - G (T - <span class=\"num\">1</span>) u</code></pre>\n+    <div class=\"source-links\">\n+      <a href=\"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/blob/7b372d79fcd3228d8d2cece73ad0181f94a70cf1/BanditRLProof/OnlineCumulativePotential.lean#L8\">Source line 8</a>\n+      <a href=\"../../chapters/online-ogd/index.html#decl-3d85ef2d0774-teaching\">Open teaching explanation</a>\n+      <a href=\"../../chapters/online-ogd/index.html\">Chapter context: Projected OGD</a>\n+    </div>\n+  </div>\n+</details></div>\n+</section>\n+</main>\n+      <aside class=\"side-nav\" data-page-toc aria-label=\"On this page\"><button class=\"side-nav-toggle\" type=\"button\" data-toc-toggle aria-controls=\"page-toc-links\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span class=\"side-nav-toggle-label\">On this page</span><span class=\"side-nav-current\" data-toc-current>Module</span><span class=\"side-nav-chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⌄</span></button><strong class=\"side-nav-label\">On this page</strong><nav class=\"side-nav-links\" id=\"page-toc-links\"><a data-toc-link href=\"#module\">Module</a><a data-toc-link href=\"#metadata\">Module map</a><a data-toc-link href=\"#declarations\">Declarations</a></nav></aside>\n+    </div>\n+    <footer class=\"site-footer\">\n+      <div class=\"footer-inner\">\n+        <p><strong>BanditRLlib</strong> is the public Lean library and community interface produced by <strong>Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep (ABRL)</strong>. Generated from current sources at 2026-10-11T09:18:03+00:00; exact Lean statements and verification status take precedence.</p>\n+        <p>Organization inspired by <a href=\"https://github.com/shosonoda/lean-ridgelet\">Sho Sonoda's Lean-Ridgelet</a> and <a href=\"https://statsmllib.github.io/\">StatsMLlib</a>; no participation or endorsement is implied. <a href=\"../../attribution/index.html\">Attribution details</a>.</p>\n+      </div>\n+    </footer>\n+  </div>\n+  <script src=\"../../static/site.js?v=20260919-taxonomy-techniques\"></script>\n+</body>\n+</html>"},{"sha":"82cafe886d811f9a1448a49ca2a7613477d6ed27","filename":"runs/online-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011/actual-reader/capture-v3/http-5.raw","status":"added","additions":3558,"deletions":0,"changes":3558,"blob_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/blob/c445c93f7e4cda1408279d614858c904e346ad47/runs%2Fonline-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011%2Factual-reader%2Fcapture-v3%2Fhttp-5.raw","raw_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/raw/c445c93f7e4cda1408279d614858c904e346ad47/runs%2Fonline-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011%2Factual-reader%2Fcapture-v3%2Fhttp-5.raw","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/contents/runs%2Fonline-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011%2Factual-reader%2Fcapture-v3%2Fhttp-5.raw?ref=c445c93f7e4cda1408279d614858c904e346ad47"},{"sha":"3d4b76440d1dbe60e11b7a1fcfe24c1114ea6208","filename":"runs/online-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011/actual-reader/capture-v3/http-6.raw","status":"added","additions":122,"deletions":0,"changes":122,"blob_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/blob/c445c93f7e4cda1408279d614858c904e346ad47/runs%2Fonline-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011%2Factual-reader%2Fcapture-v3%2Fhttp-6.raw","raw_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/raw/c445c93f7e4cda1408279d614858c904e346ad47/runs%2Fonline-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011%2Factual-reader%2Fcapture-v3%2F